* C3: current-reuse NMOS/PMOS push-pull CS LNA (Karanicolas JSSC 1996 /
* inverter-LNA lineage). Shared bias current; gm_n + gm_p attacks the
* audited gain-per-mA bind. Tuned load L2+C2 off the shared DC path.
* v0.2: in-topology bias networks (published form; default harness rules
* insert nothing for floating gates): NMOS gate via mirror ref R1->diode
* NM3 through R2; PMOS gate via diode PM2 (current set by R4) through R5.
* Input DC-blocked (C4). All values sized, none authored.
* Round-1 external, approved 2026-09-11.
C C4 VIN1 n0
L L1 n0 n1
NMOS NM1 n2 n1 VSS VSS
C C1 n1 n3
PMOS PM1 n2 n3 VDD VDD
L L2 n2 n4
C C2 n4 VSS
C C3 n2 VOUT1
R R1 VDD n5
NMOS NM3 n5 n5 VSS VSS
R R2 n5 n1
PMOS PM2 n6 n6 VDD VDD
R R4 n6 VSS
R R5 n6 n3
